cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "Protein Set Selection"
abstract: >-
  A Horus plugin that selects a small, expressible, structurally diverse subset
  of a protein family: ProteinMPNN scoring, MMseqs2 clustering, Rosetta relax,
  BioEmu ensemble sampling, Pareto ranking and codon optimisation. Developed at
  the Barcelona Supercomputing Center for the ROBUSTOO project (deliverable
  D1.3, WP1), funded by the European Union under Grant Agreement No 101135119.

